.TH RAS-MC-CTL 8 "@META_DATE@" "@META_ALIAS@" "RAS memory controller admin utility"
.SH NAME
ras-mc-ctl \- inspect EDAC DIMM information and recorded RAS events
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ras-mc-ctl
[\fIGLOBAL OPTIONS\fR] \fBdimm\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B ras-mc-ctl
[\fIGLOBAL OPTIONS\fR] \fBdatabase\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ras-mc-ctl
is a Python 3 administration utility for EDAC DIMM information and the
RAS events recorded by
.BR rasdaemon (1).
The command
.B mem
is an alias for
.BR dimm ;
.B db
is an alias for
.BR database .
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the program version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-c " " \fIFILE\fR ", " \-\-config " " \fIFILE\fR
Read database settings from an alternate environment file.
.SH DIMM COMMAND
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-mainboard
Print the detected mainboard vendor and model.
.TP
.BR \-D ", " \-\-dmidecode
Use dmidecode to obtain DIMM information.
.TP
.BR \-V " " \fIVALUE\fR ", " \-\-vendor " " \fIVALUE\fR
Override the detected mainboard vendor.
.TP
.BR \-M " " \fIVALUE\fR ", " \-\-model " " \fIVALUE\fR
Override the detected mainboard model.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-status
Print the status of the EDAC drivers.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-print-labels
Print configured and registered DIMM labels.
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-guess-labels
Print DIMM labels found in DMI data when bank locators are available.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-register-labels
Register labels from the DIMM label database in EDAC sysfs files.
.TP
.BR \-d " " \fISECONDS\fR ", " \-\-delay " " \fISECONDS\fR
Wait before registering DIMM labels.
.TP
.BR \-L " " \fIFILE\fR ", " \-\-labeldb " " \fIFILE\fR
Use an alternate DIMM label database.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-layout
Print the memory layout detected by EDAC.
.SH DATABASE COMMAND
The database backend and its connection parameters are read from the
configuration file. Missing indexes are created before records are displayed.
.TP
.B \-\-indexes-only
Create missing database indexes without displaying records.
.TP
.BI \-\-since " YYYY-MM-DD"
Only display records on or after this date.
.TP
.BI \-\-until " YYYY-MM-DD"
Only display records on or before this date.
.TP
.BI \-\-hostname " HOSTNAME"
Only display records stored for this hostname.
.SH MAINBOARD DETECTION
Explicit
.B \-\-vendor
and
.B \-\-model
values take precedence. Otherwise,
.B ras-mc-ctl
reads
.I /sys/class/dmi/id/board_vendor
and
.IR /sys/class/dmi/id/board_name .
If those files are unavailable, it falls back to
.BR dmidecode (8),
which normally requires root privileges.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I @sysconfdir@/sysconfig/rasdaemon
Default database configuration.
.TP
.I @sysconfdir@/ras/dimm_labels.db
Default DIMM label database.
.TP
.I @sysconfdir@/ras/dimm_labels.d
Additional DIMM label databases.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rasdaemon (1),
.BR dmidecode (8)
